OL,3,GNEWSABBC director-general backs Archers
OL,4,Astudio decision
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe BBC's director general has said he
OL,7,Fwas exploring options to keep the
OL,8,Frecording of The Archers in the West
OL,9,FMidlands, but added there was other
OL,10,Fstudio space around the country that
OL,11,Fcould be used.
OL,13,FPlans to build a bespoke studio for the
OL,14,Flong-running Radio 4 soap at the BBC's
OL,15,Fnew flagship Tea Factory building in
OL,16,FDigbeth, Birmingham, were shelved this
OL,17,Fweek as part of a wider drive to cut
OL,18,Fcosts.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,352,350,200,160,0,100
