OL,3,GNEWSABBC director-general backs Archers
OL,4,Astudio decision
OL,5,
OL,6,FMatt Brittin, who met with West
OL,7,FMidlands Mayor Richard Parker on
OL,8,FWednesday, said the broadcaster needed
OL,9,Fto save money, but they were working
OL,10,Ftogether to look at future recording
OL,11,Flocations.
OL,13,FThe Equity entertainment union said
OL,14,Fcast members were "angry at the
OL,15,Fproposals and will fight them".
